@startuml tool-ned-editor-spec--instance-type-detach--component
' Document: ../../tools/ned-editor/NED-editor仕様書.md
' Section: 後段拡張・選択した実体の型複製
' Purpose: 共有祖先の複製と既存network内の再結合によって実体パスを保つ
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK JP
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #64748B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
left to right direction
title 選択実体の型を独立化
package "変更前" {
  component "Net\na: Rack\nb: Rack" as BN
  component "Rack\nunit: Device" as BR
  component "Device" as BD
  BN --> BR : a / b
  BR --> BD : unit
}
package "変更後" {
  component "Net（名前を保持）\na: RackForA\nb: Rack" as AN
  component "RackForA（複製）\nunit: DeviceForA" as AR2
  component "DeviceForA（複製）" as AD2
  component "Rack（原型）\nunit: Device" as AR
  component "Device（原型）" as AD
  AN --> AR2 : a
  AR2 --> AD2 : unit
  AN --> AR : b
  AR --> AD : unit
}
BN -[hidden]-> AN
note bottom of AR2
  選択実体 Net.a.unit の型だけ独立化。
  子名・実体パス・値・結線を保持。
  INI / Gateway / workload の参照先も保持。
end note
note bottom of AR
  非選択実体 Net.b.unit は原型を使用。
  原型の宣言と配置を変更しない。
end note
@enduml
